DB-unavailable branch — run a separate local Streamlit process with only its child-process DATABASE_URL set to an unreachable loopback port. After adding psycopg connect_timeout=3, the tab rendered the friendly "chưa có dữ liệu leads" message within the bounded connection attempt, while file-based convlog metrics remained visible. Playwright assertion passed; console errors: 0. No .env or repo config was changed.

The system Python lacked the already-declared Streamlit dependency, so UI verification used an isolated temporary venv. Global protobuf was restored to its pre-test version; requirements.txt was unchanged.